## **4. Content Pipeline Enhancements**
### **4.1 Updated Pipeline Stages**
| **Stage**               | **Enhanced Functionality**                                                                 | **Tools/Modules**                          | **Compliance Check**                     |
|-------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------|
| **Persona Context Injection** | Injects backstory, struggles, and audience memory into content generation.              | Backstory Continuity Engine, LLM          | Consistency with approved persona        |
| **BTS Generation**      | Creates candid, unscripted-style content.                                                 | Stable Diffusion, Voice Cloning           | Synthetic labeling + no false claims     |
| **Struggle Simulation** | Generates relatable challenges tied to persona arcs.                                      | LLM (fine-tuned on psychology)            | No harmful/triggering content             |
| **Voice Consistency Check** | Validates replies/comments against persona voice model.                                   | RAG, Transformers                         | Tone/value alignment ≥ 0.90               |
| **Audience Memory Update** | Logs interactions to inform future replies.                                               | Neo4j, Elasticsearch                      | No PII leakage                            |

### **4.2 Disclosure Enforcement for Authentic Content**
| **Content Type**         | **Disclosure Requirement**                                                                 | **Implementation**                                                                 |
|--------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Scripted Posts**       | Full synthetic labeling + sponsorship (if applicable).                                    | Watermark + audio tag + metadata.                                                  |
| **BTS Content**          | "AI-Generated BTS" label (less prominent but still visible).                              | Smaller overlay + verbal disclaimer.                                             |
| **Struggle Posts**       | "AI-Generated Persona" + "This is a simulated scenario for engagement."                     | Text disclaimer in description + verbal tag.                                      |
| **Comment Replies**      | "As an AI, I..." (first mention per thread) + synthetic label in metadata.                 | Dynamic prefix injection.                                                        |
| **Sponsored BTS**        | Full #Ad disclosure + synthetic label.                                                    | Prepend "#Ad" to all sponsored BTS.                                                |

