## **10. Failure Modes and Mitigations**
| **Failure Mode**               | **Impact**                          | **Mitigation**                              |
|--------------------------------|-------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|
| Geospatial data unavailable    | No CDE                              | Fallback to WorldPop (unclassified).        |
| Munition data stale            | Incorrect strike options            | Nightly sync with DoD catalogs.             |
| Proportionality miscalculation | Invalid go/no-go                    | Manual review flag for edge cases.          |
| Kafka outage                   | Assessments stuck in pipeline       | Multi-AZ deployment + mirroring.            |
| ROGM service crash             | No response options generated       | Retry + alert on-call engineer.             |

