## **11. Error Handling & Monitoring**
### **11.1 Error Scenarios**
| **Scenario**                          | **Handling**                                                                 |
|---------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Stability Score not found             | Default to 100% cash disbursement; log error.                              |
| No matching disbursement rule         | Default to 100% cash disbursement; log error.                              |
| Insufficient digital credit balance   | Decline transaction; notify applicant and vendor.                         |
| Vendor not in allowlist               | Decline transaction; notify vendor.                                        |
| Payment processor failure             | Retry 3x; if failed, mark disbursement as `FAILED` and notify admin.       |
| Override approval timeout             | Escalate to supervisor after 24 hours.                                     |

