## **4. Data Model Extensions**
### **4.1 New Entities**
| **Entity**               | **Description**                                                                 | **Relationships**                          |
|--------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|
| `StabilityTrend`         | Tracks Stability Score changes across review cycles.                          | N:1 `IntakeSubmission`                     |
| `HSPTrigger`             | Record of an HSP trigger event (e.g., score degradation detected).             | N:1 `StabilityTrend`, 1:1 `HomeAssessment`  |
| `HomeAssessment`         | Details of a scheduled or completed home assessment.                           | 1:1 `HSPTrigger`, N:1 `AssessmentProvider`  |
| `AssessmentProvider`     | External vendor contracted to perform home assessments.                        | 1:N `HomeAssessment`                       |
| `BehavioralCaseSummary`  | Structured summary of case data for CFS.                                        | 1:1 `HSPTrigger`, N:1 `CFSInterfaceLog`     |
| `CFSInterfaceLog`        | Log of BCS transmissions to CFS and responses.                                 | N:1 `BehavioralCaseSummary`                 |
| `HSPConfig`              | Configuration for HSP thresholds and rules.                                    | None (singleton)                           |

