## **11. Error Handling & Monitoring**
### **11.1 Error Scenarios**
| **Scenario**                          | **Handling**                                                                 |
|---------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Stability Score missing               | Skip trend analysis for this cycle; log warning.                          |
| No available assessment provider     | Escalate to supervisor; extend `assessmentSLA` by 5 days.                  |
| CFS API unavailable                   | Retry every 4 hours for 24 hours; then escalate to admin.                 |
| Assessment provider timeout           | Mark assessment as `FAILED`; notify provider and reschedule.              |
| BCS generation failure                | Retry 3x; if failed, notify admin and manually compile BCS.                |
| CFS rejection of BCS                  | Log error; notify caseworker to review and resubmit.                       |

### **11.2 Monitoring Metrics**
| **Metric**                              | **Description**                                                                 |
|-----------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `hsp_triggers_total`                    | Total HSP triggers (by type: automatic/manual).                                |
| `hsp_assessments_scheduled`             | Number of assessments scheduled.                                               |
| `hsp_assessments_completed`             | Number of assessments completed (by provider).                                 |
| `hsp_assessment_sla_breaches`           | Count of assessments not completed within `assessmentSLA`.                   |
| `bcs_generated_total`                   | Total BCS documents generated.                                                 |
| `bcs_cfs_submission_success_rate`       | Percentage of BCS successfully submitted to CFS.                               |
| `cfs_response_time_hours`               | Average time from BCS submission to CFS response.                              |
| `hsp_workflow_duration_days`           | Average time from trigger to CFS response.                                     |

### **11.3 Alerts**
| **Alert**                              | **Condition**                                                                 | **Recipients**               |
|----------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------|
| HSP Trigger                            | New `HSPTrigger` created.                                                     | Caseworker, Supervisor       |
| Assessment Overdue                     | `HomeAssessment` not completed within `assessmentSLA`.                       | Supervisor, Provider         |
| CFS Submission Failure                 | BCS submission to CFS fails after 3 retries.                                   | Admin Team                   |
| CFS Investigation Required             | CFS returns `evaluationStatus = INVESTIGATION`.                               | Caseworker, Supervisor       |
| High-Risk Assessment Findings          | `HomeAssessment.findings.householdSafety = UNSAFE`.                           | Supervisor, CFS Liaison      |

