## **9. Non-Functional Requirements**
| **Category**          | **Requirement**                                                                 |
|-----------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Latency**           | - Packet propagation: <5 minutes for 95% of institutions.                     |
|                       | - Flagging: <1 minute for new citations.                                         |
| **Throughput**        | - Handle 100 concurrent packet propagations.                                    |
|                       | - Index 10K citations/hour.                                                     |
| **Reliability**       | - 99.9% uptime for RPS, PE, CFS, and ASD.                                        |
| **Security**          | - Revision packets signed with ECDSA.                                          |
|                       | - Sealed records accessible only to authorized users.                        |
| **Auditability**      | - Full audit trail for all packet actions, propagations, and flags.           |
| **Compliance**        | - All actions logged for FOIA requests.                                         |

---
---

## **10. Failure Modes & Mitigations**
| **Failure**                          | **Impact**                          | **Mitigation**                                      |
|--------------------------------------|-------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|
| Packet approval delay                | Slow propagation of updates         | SLA: 24 hours for approval; escalate to ministry.      |
| Propagation failure (e.g., CMS down) | Inconsistent public content        | Retry with exponential backoff; manual override.     |
| False positives in flagging          | Users incorrectly flagged           | Require 2+ citations before flagging; manual review.  |
| Score calculation error              | Incorrect compliance metrics        | Daily validation jobs; alert on anomalies.            |
| Dashboard downtime                   | No visibility into compliance       | Multi-AZ deployment; read replicas for ASD.           |

