## **9. Failure Modes & Mitigations**
| **Failure Mode**               | **Impact**                          | **Mitigation**                              |
|--------------------------------|-------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|
| EAW Trigger Engine Crash      | No EAPs generated for qualifying WAs. | Kubernetes auto-restart; fallback to FTEP. |
| EAP Assembly Failure          | Incomplete EAP sent to Commander.    | Retry (3x); fallback to raw WA + ROP.      |
| Decision Timer Failure        | Cancellation window not enforced.   | Redis failover; manual timer override.     |
| Commander Action Failure      | Cannot approve/reject EAP.          | Fallback to **voice command** (always available). |
| Command Routing Failure        | Approved commands not executed.     | Fallback to **GCCS/DCGS**.                  |
| Retaliatory Queue Failure      | Packets lost or delayed.           | Kafka replication; manual queue recovery. |
| False EAW Activation           | Unnecessary EAP sent to Commander.  | Post-event review + threshold tuning.      |

