#### **Pharmacy Benefits Manager (PBM)**
- **Purpose**: Verify medication adherence (e.g., mental health prescriptions).
- **API Endpoint**: `https://pbm.nyc.gov/api/v3/medications`
- **Authentication**: Mutual TLS.
- **Request**:
