## **10. Error Handling & Monitoring**
### **10.1 Error Scenarios**
| **Scenario**                          | **Handling**                                                                 |
|---------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Third-party API timeout               | Retry 3x with exponential backoff; log error; notify admin.                |
| Third-party API authentication failure| Refresh credentials; retry; escalate to platform admin.                    |
| No compliance data for period         | Mark as `NON_COMPLIANT`; notify caseworker.                                  |
| Disbursement release failure          | Retry 3x; if failed, mark as `FAILED` and escalate to payment team.          |
| Override approval timeout             | Escalate to supervisor after 24 hours.                                       |
| Applicant disputes compliance status   | Caseworker reviews and updates `ComplianceVerification` with notes.         |

