## **6. Reward Cadence Scheduler**
### **6.1 Reward Types & Costs**
| **Reward Type**       | **Description**                          | **Cost to Consortium** | **Redemption Rate** | **Use Case**                     |
|-----------------------|------------------------------------------|------------------------|--------------------|----------------------------------|
| Points                | Loyalty points (1 point = $0.01).        | $0.01/point            | High               | Frequent micro-rewards.          |
| Discount Voucher      | Fixed $ off next purchase.               | Face value + redemption rate | Medium       | Weekly/milestone rewards.        |
| Free Product          | Single comfort item.                     | COGS ($2-5)             | High               | High-value re-engagement.        |
| Free Shipping          | Waived delivery fee.                     | $5-10                  | Medium             | Urgent escalation.               |
| Priority Access       | Early sale access.                       | $0 (operational)       | Low                | VIP customers.                   |

### **6.2 Scheduling Logic**
- **Immediate Rewards:** Triggered by **specific actions** (e.g., first replenishment loop use).
- **Time-Based Rewards:** Scheduled **daily/weekly** (e.g., "Weekly bonus: $5 off").
- **Milestone Rewards:** Unlocked after **consecutive target achievements** (e.g., 3 weeks of steady spending).
- **Escalation Rewards:** Deployed when **spending drops below threshold**.

**API Contract:**
**Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/rewards/schedule`
**Request:**
```json
{
  "customer_id": "CUST-12345",
  "reward": {
    "type": "discount",
    "value": 5.00,
    "message": "Your weekly bonus: $5 off!",
    "condition": "spend >= 100.00"
  },
  "schedule": {
    "type": "weekly",
    "start_date": "2023-11-20T00:00:00Z",
    "end_date": "2023-12-20T00:00:00Z",
    "day_of_week": "monday",
    "time": "09:00"
  }
}
```

