## **9. Escalation Manager**
### **9.1 Escalation Steps**
| **Condition**                          | **Action**                                                                                     | **Priority** |
|----------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------|
| Spending < 0.8 × steadiness target      | Increase trigger frequency (e.g., daily → twice daily).                                    | Medium       |
| Spending < 0.5 × steadiness target      | Deploy micro-reward (e.g., free product).                                                     | High         |
| No purchases for 7 days (Low Steadiness)| Route to abstainer detection.                                                                | High         |
| No purchases for 3 days (At-Risk)      | Route to abstainer detection + deploy VIP reward (e.g., free delivery for 30 days).         | Critical     |
| Abstainer score ≥ 70                    | Move to monitoring queue + suppress all non-comfort offers.                                  | Critical     |

