## **12. Risk Mitigation**
| **Risk**                          | **Mitigation Strategy**                                      |
|-----------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Script fatigue** (customers ignore triggers) | **A/B test trigger frequency** and **rotate messaging**. |
| **Reward abuse** (gaming the system) | **Rate limiting** (e.g., max 1 free product per week). |
| **False abstainer flags**         | **Human review** for scores 60-80. Use **ensemble models**. |
| **Over-downranking** (lost sales) | **Monitor revenue impact** and adjust boost factors. |
| **Dashboard overload**            | **Prioritize alerts** (e.g., only show critical escalations). |

