## **14. Compliance & Ethics**
- **Transparency:**
  - Customers can **view their consumption script** (e.g., "You’re receiving these offers to help maintain your routine").
  - **Opt-out:** Customers can **disable desire orchestration** (falls back to standard personalization).
- **Fairness:**
  - **Audit scripts** for bias (e.g., do certain demographics get fewer rewards?).
  - **Equal access to staples:** Even abstainers can buy essentials.
- **Data Governance:**
  - **Retention:** Scripts stored for **90 days**; abstainer flags purged after **1 year**.
  - **Anonymization:** Aggregated data **never tied to PII** in analytics.

