## **7. Clinician Review Workflow**
### **7.1 Clinician Actions**
| **Action**               | **Description**                                                                 | **API Endpoint**                          |
|--------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------|
| View Case Packet         | Clinician retrieves full packet for review.                                  | `GET /api/v1/eap/cases/{caseId}`          |
| Request Additional Info  | Clinician requests more data (e.g., medical records).                      | `POST /api/v1/eap/cases/{caseId}/request_info` |
| Approve Recommendation   | Clinician approves pre-filled or modified recommendation.                    | `POST /api/v1/eap/cases/{caseId}/approve` |
| Reject Recommendation    | Clinician rejects and provides alternative (rare).                          | `POST /api/v1/eap/cases/{caseId}/reject`  |
| Submit Clearance         | Clinician submits final clearance decision.                                | `POST /api/v1/eap/cases/{caseId}/clearance` |

