## **8. Psychiatric Review Queue Integration**
### **8.1 Queue Adaptors**
The ECC API supports **multiple psychiatric review systems**:

| **System** | **Integration Method** | **Endpoint** | **Payload Format** |
|------------|------------------------|--------------|--------------------|
| **EHR (Epic/Cerner)** | FHIR `Task` | `POST /fhir/Task` | FHIR `Task` + `EscalationPacket` reference |
| **Standalone Queue** | REST API | `POST /api/queue` | Custom JSON (mapped from `EscalationPacket`) |
| **SMART on FHIR App** | FHIR API | `POST /fhir/EscalationPacket` | FHIR `EscalationPacket` |

#### **Example: Submit to EHR via FHIR Task**
```json
{
  "resourceType": "Task",
  "status": "ready",
  "intent": "order",
  "priority": 1, // High priority
  "code": {
    "coding": [
      {
        "system": "http://lifeline.example/fhir/CodeSystem/task-type",
        "code": "psychiatric-review",
        "display": "Psychiatric Review"
      }
    ]
  },
  "subject": { "reference": "Patient/patient-12345" },
  "description": "Escalation packet for Alex Johnson (High Resistance). Recommended: Partial Hospitalization.",
  "focus": { "reference": "EscalationPacket/ecc-packet-98765" },
  "for": { "reference": "PractitionerRole/psychiatrist" }, // Assigned to any psychiatrist
  "extension": [
    {
      "url": "http://lifeline.example/fhir/StructureDefinition/task-escalation-priority",
      "valueCode": "high"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://lifeline.example/fhir/StructureDefinition/task-recommended-placement",
      "valueCodeableConcept": {
        "coding": [{ "system": "http://lifeline.example/fhir/CodeSystem/placement-type", "code": "partial-hospitalization" }]
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

