| **Term** | **Definition** |
|----------|----------------|
| **Escalation Packet** | A structured payload containing monitoring history, risk/resistance scores, and a treatment recommendation for psychiatric review. |
| **Treatment Placement Recommendation** | A clinically validated suggestion for higher-control treatment (e.g., PHP, inpatient). |
| **Non-Compliance Detector** | The component that identifies sustained non-compliance across medication, appointments, and partner verifications. |
| **Psychiatric Review Queue** | The system (EHR or standalone) where escalation packets are routed for psychiatrist approval. |
| **Higher-Control Treatment Placement** | A more intensive level of care (e.g., PHP, inpatient) for patients with sustained non-compliance. |

