|---------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **COMP-001**        | `disclosure_method == NONE AND sponsorship == true`                         | **BLOCK** – Reject with error: "Sponsored content requires disclosure."                         |
| **COMP-002**        | `explicit_claim_detected == true`                                            | **BLOCK** – Replace with approved fallback (e.g., "Based on my experience...").               |
| **COMP-003**        | `disclosure_visibility < 0.95`                                               | **WARN** – Add secondary disclosure method.                                                   |
| **COMP-004**        | `trust_score < 0.80`                                                        | **WARN** – Review persona for inconsistencies or unrelatable traits.                          |
| **COMP-005**        | `immersion_drop > 0.10`                                                      | **WARN** – Adjust disclosure placement or method.                                             |

