## **10. Compliance & Ethical Safeguards**
---
### **10.1 Ethical Guardrails**
| **Risk**                          | **Mitigation**                                                                 |
|-----------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Deceptive Practices**           | All disclosures are **explicit and unmissable** per FTC/DoD.                 |
| **Manipulation of Audience**      | **A/B tests** are limited to **10% of audience** per variant.                 |
| **Psychological Harm**            | Vulnerability arcs are reviewed by **mental health professionals**.         |
| **False Endorsements**            | **NLP scans** block explicit claims (e.g., "I use this every day").            |
| **Data Privacy**                  | Audience data is **aggregated and anonymized**; no PII stored.                |

---
### **10.2 Compliance Checklist**
- [ ] All sponsored content includes **FTC-compliant disclosures**.
- [ ] Disclosures are **visible and unambiguous** (e.g., "#Ad", "Sponsored").
- [ ] No **explicit false claims** (e.g., "I am a real person").
- [ ] **Implied expertise** is framed as opinion (e.g., "Based on my experience...").
- [ ] **Audience testing** confirms disclosure visibility ≥ 95%.
- [ ] **Approval workflow** includes **Legal/DoD PAO** sign-off.

